OL,3,AThe convicted #33m tax fraudster
OL,4,Aevading justice and living it up in
OL,5,ADubai
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the UK's most prolific
OL,8,Ffraudsters, described by a judge as a
OL,9,F"breathtakingly arrogant" and "totally
OL,10,Fdishonest" man, remains on the run in
OL,11,FDubai after stealing more than #33m of
OL,12,Fpublic money.
OL,14,FArif Patel, from Preston in Lancashire,
OL,15,Fwas exposed following a complex
OL,16,Finvestigation spanning years, led by
OL,17,FHis Majesty's Revenue and Customs
OL,18,F(HMRC), which established that he had
OL,19,Ftried to steal as much as #90m.
