OL,3,AThe convicted #33m tax fraudster
OL,4,Aevading justice and living it up in
OL,5,ADubai
OL,6,
OL,7,FPatel, who skipped the UK in 2011 never
OL,8,Fto return, was eventually convicted in
OL,9,Fhis absence and in 2023 was handed a
OL,10,F20-year prison sentence.
OL,12,FBBC File on 4 Investigates has been on
OL,13,Fthe trail of the man who stole from all
OL,14,Fof us - and seemingly got away with it.
